References: <20030204043617.64102.qmail@web40614.mail.yahoo.com>
Message-ID: <1044334078.1200.87.camel@bmbbox.dyndns.org>

> I also encountered a similar doubt regarding the
> medianpolish option which I think to be a Tukey's
> biweight procedure. Please guide me about the same.
> Also, is there a way/documentation by which  one can
> understand the logic behind various options ?

Median polish is not the same as Tukeys biweight, the median polish is a
multi array measure based upon fitting a model with probe and chip
effects robustly. You can get  the Tukey Biweight type measure using
summary.method="mas".

Thanks,

Ben


